Subject: [PATCH 2/3] feat(rfork): log checkpoint layout candidates

Record bounded checkpoint-layout summaries before post-load processing so prefill and decode candidates can be compared without changing transfer behavior. Keep diagnostic failures observational and cover both transfer paths.

Signed-off-by: yangsonglin13 <yangsonglin566@gmail.com>
